46
00:03:32,498 --> 00:03:37,521
So what we're actually building in
OpenEverest is that a model is a service.

47
00:03:37,534 --> 00:03:43,548
So on the left, you have the people or
the applications that need the model.

48
00:03:43,548 --> 00:03:47,241
It can be a chat application,
a search feature, someone's,

49
00:03:47,323 --> 00:03:49,136
notebook or automation.

50
00:03:49,834 --> 00:03:56,487
And, what they do, all of them, they
call a single URL, which is OpenAI

51
00:03:56,509 --> 00:04:01,448
compatible endpoint, and, they
should not care where the model runs.

52
00:04:01,492 --> 00:04:04,062
They just call it out and
something should happen.

53
00:04:04,815 --> 00:04:09,329
And behind that URL is where
